@model ReferralLanding
@{ViewData["Title"]="A friend's introduction";var i=Model.Input;}
<div class="referral-landing"><section class="landing-story"><span class="eyebrow">A DEDICATED CUSTOMER REFERRAL PORTAL</span><h1>Your next chapter starts with a conversation.</h1><p><strong>@Model.Owner.Name.Split(' ')[0]</strong> has shared an introduction. Discover how your home equity could support your goals.</p><div class="benefit-pair"><div><span>FOR THE REFERRING CUSTOMER</span><strong>$50</strong></div><div><span>FOR THE NEW CUSTOMER</span><strong>$25</strong></div></div><p class="field-help">Illustrative CAD rewards in this demo, after qualifying funding and approval. An enquiry does not earn a reward.</p><h2>At your pace, in your home.</h2><p>Explore reverse mortgage options with a specialist. Eligibility, interest, fees and repayment terms apply.</p><a href="https://www.homeequitybank.ca/products/chip-reverse-mortgage/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn about HomeEquity Bank's offering ↗</a></section>
<section class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">LET'S GET IN TOUCH</span><h2>Request a friendly follow-up.</h2><p>Submit once to send your enquiry to a demo salesperson and automatically create your customer demo account. Already have an account? Sign in before submitting.</p>
<form asp-action="Enquire" method="post"><div asp-validation-summary="All" class="validation" role="alert"></div><input type="hidden" name="Code" value="@i.Code"/><input type="hidden" name="InvitationId" value="@i.InvitationId"/>
<label for="enquiry-name">Full name</label><input id="enquiry-name" name="Name" value="@i.Name" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name"/>
<label for="enquiry-email">Email address</label><input id="enquiry-email" name="Email" value="@i.Email" type="email" required maxlength="160" autocomplete="email"/>
<label for="enquiry-phone">Phone number</label><input id="enquiry-phone" name="Phone" value="@i.Phone" type="tel" required maxlength="30" autocomplete="tel"/><small>10–15 digits, including country code where needed.</small>
<label for="enquiry-interest">I would like to discuss</label><select id="enquiry-interest" name="Interest">@foreach(var topic in new[]{"Reverse mortgage","Income Solution","General enquiry"}){<option selected="@(i.Interest==topic)">@topic</option>}</select>
<label class="consent-line"><input type="checkbox" name="Consent" value="true" checked="@i.Consent" required/> I would like a salesperson to contact me and agree to create a demo customer account if I am new.</label>
<p class="field-help">One referral code stays attached to your profile and cannot be replaced. Rewards require qualifying funding and approval. New customers do not need a separate registration or onboarding step.</p><p><a href="/customer/login">Existing customer? Sign in</a></p><p class="field-help">Demo only: no call, email or SMS is actually sent.</p><button class="button full">Submit enquiry →</button></form></section></div>
